Visitors to the 4th International Autism Conference, organised by 
@zhocare
, have discussed keeping up to date with latest developments, exploring artificial intelligence in diagnostics and data analysis, and connecting with service providers to support People of Determination.

Organised by 
@zhoCare
, the 4th International Autism Conference brought together global experts to advance an integrated ecosystem supporting individuals with autism, reinforcing inclusion, independence, and sustainable impact for families and communities.
